# Self-inflicted release-hygiene churn: regenerated on every run, no review value.
# Historical dated snapshots (coordination/release-intake/YYYY-MM-DD-*) stay tracked.
# `latest-A25-*` pointers are rewritten by `npm run release:dirty-map`.
coordination/release-intake/latest-A25-*.json
coordination/release-intake/latest-A25-*.md
# `hk-zh-word-*` are rewritten by `npm run check:hk-zh`.
coordination/reports/hk-zh-word-audit.md
coordination/reports/hk-zh-word-inventory.json
